<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Active Sports - Play Hard, Shine Bright</title>
    <!-- Link to External CSS -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>

<!-- Header -->
<div class="header-container">
    <h1>Active Sports Club</h1>
    <p><b>"Discipline. Humble. Teamwork. Hardwork."</b></p>
</div>
<hr class="hr-top">

<!-- Banner -->
<div class="banner-container">
    <img src="sports_banners.png" width="750" height="250" alt="Sports Banner">
    <p><i>Dream as big you can dream, and anything is possible.</i></p>
</div>

<!-- About Section -->
<h1>About Our Club</h1>
<table class="about-table">
    <tr>
        <th>Our Mission</th>
        <th>Available Sports</th>
        <th>Who Can Join</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>Promote Fitness, Sportmanship, and Humbleness in competition among students and youth.</td>
        <td>Basketball, Volleyball, Badminton, Table Tennis, and Athletics.</td>
        <td>All whoever wants - Beginners, Advance Players, and Professional Players.</td>
    </tr>
</table>

<hr style="width:90%; height:4px;">

<!-- Programs Section -->
<h1>Our Sports Programs</h1>
<p><b>Choose your game and start your passion!</b></p>
<table class="programs-table">
    <tr>
        <td>
            <img src="basketball.webp" width="150" height="150" alt="Basketball"><br>
            <b>Basketball</b>
        </td>
        <td>
            <img src="volleyball.webp" width="150" height="150" alt="Volleyball"><br>
            <b>Volleyball</b>
        </td>
        <td>
            <img src="badminton.avif" width="150" height="150" alt="Badminton"><br>
            <b>Badminton</b>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>

<hr style="width:90%; height:4px;">

<!-- Why Play Sports -->
<h2>Why Play Sports?</h2>
<div class="why-container">
    <p>Sports are more than just games — it builds character.</p>
    <p>Regular physical activity keeps your body strong, your mind sharp, and helps you manage stress better.</p>
    <p>Respect the game, respect your teammates, and always give your best effort.</p>
</div>

<hr style="width:90%; height:4px;">

<!-- Registration Form -->
<h1>Join Now to Become Better!</h1>
<p><b>Fill out the form below to sign up for training and club updates.</b></p>
<form action="#" method="post">
    <table class="form-table">
        <tr>
            <td><label for="fname">Full Name:</label></td>
            <td><input type="text" id="fname" name="fullname" size="30" required></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><label for="email">Email Address:</label></td>
            <td><input type="email" id="email" name="email" size="30" required></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><label for="number">Contact Number:</label></td>
            <td><input type="tel" id="number" name="phone" size="30"></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Gender:</td>
            <td>
                <input type="radio" id="male" name="gender" value="Male">
                <label for="male">Male</label>
                <input type="radio" id="female" name="gender" value="Female">
                <label for="female">Female</label>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Sport Interest:</td>
            <td>
                <input type="checkbox" id="bb" name="sport" value="Basketball">
                <label for="bb">Basketball</label>
                <input type="checkbox" id="vb" name="sport" value="Volleyball">
                <label for="vb">Volleyball</label>
                <input type="checkbox" id="bm" name="sport" value="Badminton">
                <label for="bm">Badminton</label>
                <input type="checkbox" id="at" name="sport" value="Athletics">
                <label for="at">Athletics</label>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td></td>
            <td>
                <input type="submit" value="Register Now">
                <input type="reset" value="Clear Form">
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</form>

<hr class="footer-hr">

<!-- Footer -->
<div class="footer-text">
    <p><i>Active Sports Club. All Rights Reserved.</i></p>
    <p>Created by: <b>Brent Joshua L. Perez</b> | <b>BSIT 2B</b></p>
</div>

</body>
</html>
